{'symbol': 'INCY', 'date': '2022-03-18 09:56:00', 'title': 'INCYTE ANNOUNCES MULTIPLE ABSTRACTS FROM ITS DERMATOLOGY PORTFOLIO HAVE BEEN ACCEPTED FOR PRESENTATION AT THE 2022 AMERICAN ACADEMY OF DERMATOLOGY (AAD) ANNUAL MEETING', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $INCY #AAD2022--INCYTE (NASDAQ:INCY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MULTIPLE ABSTRACTS FEATURING DATA FROM ITS DERMATOLOGY PORTFOLIO WILL BE PRESENTED AT THE UPCOMING AMERICAN ACADEMY OF DERMATOLOGY (AAD) ANNUAL MEETING, HELD MARCH 25-29, 2022, IN BOSTON. NEW 52-WEEK DATA FROM THE PHASE 3 TRUE-V VITILIGO PROGRAM EVALUATING THE SAFETY AND EFFICACY OF RUXOLITINIB CREAM IN ADOLESCENT AND ADULT PATIENTS (AGE ≥12 YEARS) WITH VITILIGO WILL BE PRESENTED AS AN ORAL PRESENTATION IN A LATE-BREAK'}